# Clearmark pipeline outputs — never commit live or dry-run output CSVs.
# The resume logic keys on email address: if a mock dry-run row sits in the
# output file, the live run skips that email and leaves fake findings in place.
# Always use a fresh filename (e.g. batch_00_live.csv) for real runs.
*_ready.csv
*_live.csv
